82164c6e76e3e204.png)\n\nThe circle with center $O$ is inscribed into the equilateral triangle $△XYZ$, as shown above. Select the correct options about the properties of the construction below. {{field-1}}\nis the radius of the circle.\n\n{{field-2}}\nis an isosceles triangle.\n\n{{field-3}}\nhas a measure of $120^{∘}$.\n\n{{field-4}}\nis a $30$-$60$-$90$ triangle.\n\n{{field-5}}\nhas a measure of $30^{∘}$." 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213694 1072 #uuid "9ce88fbe-5b11-5d64-a861-313bd83af63e" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213695 1068 #edb/ref 17592186211989 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213695 1069 "q-301588" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213695 1071 "${3x - 5y = 12; 6x - 10y = b$\n\nIn the system of equations above, $b$ is a constant. If the system has infinitely many solutions, what is the value of $b$?" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213695 1072 #uuid "a6af1d3a-0f72-552a-b324-51492a72b1b0" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213696 1068 #edb/ref 17592186211995 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213696 1069 "q-301594" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213696 1071 "${\\frac{5}{6}x - \\frac{1}{3}y = \\frac{4}{5}; gx + ky = \\frac{8}{3}$\n\nIn the system of equations above, $g$ and $k$ are constants. If the system has infinitely many solutions, what is the value of $\\frac{g}{k}$?" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213696 1072 #uuid "444102ee-2622-5be6-88c8-9f6cb9b33789" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213697 1068 #edb/ref 17592186212001 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213697 1069 "q-301595" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213697 1071 "A national chain of restaurants wants to determine the average number of hours its chefs spend preparing food each week. Why might the company choose to use a sample instead of a census?" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213697 1072 #uuid "84cd236d-3bd0-5134-97b3-6cf29c9f59f0" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213698 1068 #edb/ref 17592186212007 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213698 1069 "q-301596" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213698 1071 "${\\frac{2}{3}x - \\frac{1}{4}y = 5; mx - 2y = k$\n\nIn the system of equations above, $m$ and $k$ are constants. If the system has infinitely many solutions, what is the value of $m$?" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213698 1072 #uuid "5fa6a188-6e28-55d4-ab05-e8117a46f97e" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213699 1068 #edb/ref 17592186212013 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213699 1069 "q-301597" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213699 1071 "A wildlife research team wants to estimate the average weight of deer across an entire state. Why might the team choose to use a sample instead of conducting a census?" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213699 1072 #uuid "3dd1e98e-aae2-5180-8b7a-693901ae21da" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213700 1068 #edb/ref 17592186212019 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213700 1069 "q-301605" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213700 1071 "${\\frac{1}{4}x - \\frac{1}{3}y = \\frac{1}{12}; 4x - \\frac{k}{3}y = \\frac{4}{3}$\n\nIn the system of equations above, $k$ is a constant. If the system has infinitely many solutions, what is the value of $k$?" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213700 1072 #uuid "703df2bf-97e3-5b73-a9d0-377c27eb9bef" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213701 1068 #edb/ref 17592186212025 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213701 1069 "q-301611" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213701 1071 "A nationwide parcel delivery company wants to estimate the average number of minutes drivers spend on each delivery.\n\nWhy might the company decide **NOT** to conduct a census to gather this information?" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213701 1072 #uuid "0a3f4571-c312-5995-9492-1c16d0ce732b" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213702 1068 #edb/ref 17592186212031 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213702 1069 "q-301614" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213702 1071 "${y =-\\frac{2}{3}x + 5; y = 2kx + 7$\nConsider the system of equations above, where $k$ is a constant. If the system has no solution, what is the value of $k$?" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213702 1072 #uuid "543bab86-b91b-57de-b194-80a954c53742" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213703 1068 #edb/ref 17592186212037 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213703 1069 "q-301621" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213703 1071 "A national health organization wants to study the dietary habits of all hospital patients in the country.\n\nWhy might the organization decide to conduct a census instead of using a sample to gather this information?" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213703 1072 #uuid "90a43824-e6c9-5a9a-88e7-d59ac067afcb" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213704 1068 #edb/ref 17592186212043 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213704 1069 "q-301637" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213704 1071 "${4 + 5y = qx; 5y - 3x = 3x + 9$\nConsider the system of equations above, where $q$ is a constant. If the system has no solution, what is the value of $q$?" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213704 1072 #uuid "c0aafb54-dc99-5290-9fff-30363fafb3de" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213705 1068 #edb/ref 17592186212049 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213705 1069 "q-301668" 13194139533377 17592186045585 true] [17592186213705 1071 "A city council wants to estimate the average amount of time residents spend commuting to work each day.\n\nWhich of the following sampling methods is most likely to produce unbiased results?\n\n1. Posting a survey on the city’s website and asking visitors to respond.\n2. Randomly selecting residents from the city